		(property "Description" "A pogo module's place on the keyboard board (joystick/Alpsalpine-pogo, trackball/PMW3610-pogo, by joystick/joystick-mount-pogo): the module in its printed cartridge (the joystick's retainer, the trackball's seat), whose base stands on this board with a spigot in each of the four 2.2 mm holes, at (+-12.35, +-10.85), the same both sides so all four screws go in from the top, clear of a trackball's ball seat (16.4 mm off the axis). Or the module on four 4 mm M2 standoffs, or on M2 locating pins at the PIN corners and a 4 x 2 mm disc magnet pair at each MAG corner (north up on this board). The courtyard is what the case opens round. No 3D model of the module here: the config's assemblies place it as a part of its own (ErgoCai.modules joystick/Alpsalpine-pogo/Alpsalpine-pogo.glb, trackball/PMW3610-pogo/PMW3610-pogo.glb)"
